<div class="fcb-bottom-grid"><section class="fcb-card-admin"><h2><?php esc_html_e('From setup to your first conversation',self::DOMAIN); ?></h2><ol class="fcb-help-steps"><li><?php esc_html_e('Open Easy Setup. Choose contact methods and enter their destinations.',self::DOMAIN); ?></li><li><?php esc_html_e('Choose a design and try its desktop/mobile preview. Preview links never navigate away.',self::DOMAIN); ?></li><li><?php esc_html_e('Review privacy and notifications. Publish to make your widget visible.',self::DOMAIN); ?></li><li><?php esc_html_e('Review callback requests in Enquiries when local storage is enabled.',self::DOMAIN); ?></li></ol><a class="fcb-button fcb-button-primary" href="<?php echo esc_url(admin_url('admin.php?page=fcb-setup')); ?>"><?php esc_html_e('Open Easy Setup',self::DOMAIN); ?></a><h3><?php esc_html_e('What happens after a click?',self::DOMAIN); ?></h3><p><?php esc_html_e('Your browser opens the selected service. It cannot tell whether a call connected or a message was sent. The optional fallback appears on supported page-return events and is always available through Request a Callback. Dismissed automatic prompts stay closed for the browsing session.',self::DOMAIN); ?></p><h3><?php esc_html_e('Why did a notification fail?',self::DOMAIN); ?></h3><p><?php esc_html_e('WordPress uses your configured mail transport. Use Send test email in Privacy & Mail to check acceptance, then check the recipient inbox and spam folder. Transport acceptance never confirms delivery. With the inbox enabled, saved requests remain available even if notification fails.',self::DOMAIN); ?></p></section>
